        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dick Miller, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Linda Hamilton, Roger Corman, Richard Devon, Susan Cabot\n- Films: Gremlins, The Explorers, Piranha, The Howling, A Bucket of Blood, The Little Shop of Horrors, Chopping Mall, Night of the Creeps, The Terminator, The 'Burbs, Small Soldiers, War of the Satellites\n- Games and Systems: Neuroshima, Fallout\n- Concepts: cyborg assassin, time travel, post-apocalyptic future\n\nFacts:\n- War of the Satellites was produced and directed by Roger Corman and starred Richard Devon, Dick Miller, and Susan Cabot.\n- Dick Miller's main roles included Gremlins, The Explorers, Piranha, The Howling, A Bucket of Blood, The Little Shop of Horrors, Chopping Mall, Night of the Creeps, The Terminator, The 'Burbs, and Small Soldiers.\n- The Terminator stars Arnold Schwarzenegger as a cyborg assassin sent back in time from 2029 to 1984 to kill Sarah Connor, who is played by Linda Hamilton.\n- In The Terminator, Sarah Connor's son is destined to become a savior against machines in a post-apocalyptic future.\n- Neuroshima is a Polish tabletop roleplaying system inspired by Mad Max, Fallout, The Matrix, and Terminator.",
